From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LECH OS <dev@lech-os.invalid>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add a Java library of the aapt2 protos for arsclib

tools/arsclib of GrapheneOS reads compiled resources with the Java classes
of the aapt2 protos (module aapt2_proto_java, as in GrapheneOS). adevtool
uses arsclib for the overlays when it generates the vendor module of the
Pixel 9 for LECH OS (task E2-11b, manifests/lech-pixel.xml).
---
 tools/aapt2/Android.bp | 12 ++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+)

diff --git a/tools/aapt2/Android.bp b/tools/aapt2/Android.bp
index 687e7a4..0285850 100644
--- a/tools/aapt2/Android.bp
+++ b/tools/aapt2/Android.bp
@@ -20,2 +20,14 @@ package {
 
+// LECH OS: Java classes of the aapt2 protos (Resources.proto…), as in GrapheneOS. tools/arsclib of GrapheneOS
+// needs them; adevtool uses arsclib for the overlays of the Pixel (task E2-11b, manifests/lech-pixel.xml).
+java_library_host {
+    name: "aapt2_proto_java",
+    srcs: [
+        "*.proto",
+    ],
+    proto: {
+        type: "full",
+    },
+}
+
 toolSources = [
-- 
